  "originalIdentityNotes": [
    "Silk (2015) #1-7 is the first series, pinned prior guide series 19661; second-series #1-19 and crossover #7-8 belong to prior guide series 20499. Distinct volume keys are required despite identical titles, year and issue numbers.",
    "Spider-Gwen (2015B) #7-8 is the second series, pinned prior guide series 20505, not first-series 19670. Do not apply another guide's alternating crossover reading order to this article's grouped Collects order.",
    "Spider-Women Alpha #1, Spider-Women Omega #1 and Sins of Norman Osborn #1 are one-shot original identities. FCBD 2020 Spider-Man/Venom #1 selects its Spider-Man story; verify the original anthology metadata in mapping.",
    "Spider(fly) Effect #1-8 requires original digital/Infinite-format identities; #1 resolves to original issue 57973 in series 21127, while #2-8 remain seven explicit original-identity gaps. No print issue substitutes for a digital chapter.",
    "The source's 2015 Amazing Spider-Man relaunch #1 is distinct from Amazing Spider-Man (2014) #1. Pandemonium identifies Agents of Atlas original 2019 #1-4, not the collection or issue #5.",
    "The 2021 line's 'available as of this writing' is the historical source's scope qualifier, not a current Marvel Unlimited availability claim.",
    "The first original cover target is Amazing Spider-Man (2014) #1, verified as issue 45798 in series 17285."
